                                                "sense_id": "59e2b2ed-1df1-3aa6-a264-4ee521e2cbe2",
                                                "text": "Launching Monday, the new multi-rider feature will allow up to five riders to use the same Key card when taking a SEPTA bus, trolley, the Broad Street Line, the Market-Frankford Line, the Norristown High Speed Line and Regional Rail.(…) Riders will need to tap on and tap off to get the correct fare."
